  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6502.10 “Rolling re-test” or “random re-test” means a test or tests taken at unpredictable intervals of time after the first test that allows the starting or operation of a motor vehicle.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 6500) #13448, eff 9-20-22",
